{"parse":{"title":"个性/星海的观测者","pageid":8780,"revid":21855,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E6%98%9F%E6%B5%B7%E7%9A%84%E8%A7%82%E6%B5%8B%E8%80%85&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E6%98%9F%E6%B5%B7%E7%9A%84%E8%A7%82%E6%B5%8B%E8%80%85&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E6%98%9F%E6%B5%B7%E7%9A%84%E8%A7%82%E6%B5%8B%E8%80%85&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>星海的观测者</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E6.98.9F.E6.B5.B7.E7.9A.84.E8.A7.82.E6.B5.8B.E8.80.85\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"星海的观测者\"><b>星海的观测者</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">个性详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"个性 星海的观测者.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/1c/ams06vjj32gq3fmod85sdkn3xbvxc90.png/80px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E6%98%9F%E6%B5%B7%E7%9A%84%E8%A7%82%E6%B5%8B%E8%80%85.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/1c/ams06vjj32gq3fmod85sdkn3xbvxc90.png/120px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E6%98%9F%E6%B5%B7%E7%9A%84%E8%A7%82%E6%B5%8B%E8%80%85.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/1/1c/ams06vjj32gq3fmod85sdkn3xbvxc90.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />星海的观测者\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:60%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦拥有技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"召唤•虚空投影\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">召唤•虚空投影</font></span></span>]；[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"命运刻度\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">命运刻度</font></span></span>]初始刻度为<font color=\"#ed7950\">6</font>，行动结束时推移<font color=\"#ed7950\">4</font>个刻度。<br />✦自身可透过[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虚空投影\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">虚空投影</font></span></span>]，触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"施法锚点\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">施法锚点</font></span></span>]效果来释放技能。<br />✦自身或[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虚空投影\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">虚空投影</font></span></span>]范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内，所有非[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">召唤物</span>]的己方获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"时空漫游\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">时空漫游</font></span></span>]。<br />✦攻击时，与目标距离每多<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>格（相邻距离算0格），魔攻提高<font color=\"#d68fe2\">2%</font>，最多<font color=\"#d68fe2\">10%</font>。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><b>该个性属于</b><br /><br /><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:90px;height:90px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E8%8F%B2%E5%A8%9C%E5%A1%94\" title=\"角色图鉴库/菲娜塔\"><img alt=\"头像 菲娜塔.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/9/9a/mbky2xr3jylmg6ukbyu7wjhkeowedjc.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:90px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">菲娜塔</font></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦拥有技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"召唤•虚空投影\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">召唤•虚空投影</font></span></span>]；[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"命运刻度\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">命运刻度</font></span></span>]初始刻度为<font color=\"#ed7950\">6</font>，行动结束时推移<font color=\"#ed7950\">4</font>个刻度。<br />✦自身可透过[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虚空投影\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">虚空投影</font></span></span>]，触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"施法锚点\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">施法锚点</font></span></span>]效果来释放技能。<br />✦自身或[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虚空投影\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">虚空投影</font></span></span>]范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内，所有非[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">召唤物</span>]的己方获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"时空漫游\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">时空漫游</font></span></span>]。<br />✦攻击时，与目标距离每多<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>格（相邻距离算0格），魔攻提高<font color=\"#d68fe2\">2%</font>，最多<font color=\"#d68fe2\">10%</font>。<br />✦行动开始时推移<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>个刻度。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦拥有技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"召唤•虚空投影\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">召唤•虚空投影</font></span></span>]；[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"命运刻度\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">命运刻度</font></span></span>]初始刻度为<font color=\"#ed7950\">6</font>，行动结束时推移<font color=\"#ed7950\">4</font>个刻度。<br />✦自身可透过[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虚空投影\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">虚空投影</font></span></span>]，触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"施法锚点\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">施法锚点</font></span></span>]效果来释放技能。<br />✦自身或[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虚空投影\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">虚空投影</font></span></span>]范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内，所有非[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">召唤物</span>]的己方获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"时空漫游\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">时空漫游</font></span></span>]。<br />✦攻击时，与目标距离每多<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>格（相邻距离算0格），魔攻提高<font color=\"#d68fe2\">3%</font>，最多<font color=\"#d68fe2\">15%</font>。<br />✦行动开始时推移<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>个刻度。<br />✦以触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"施法锚点\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">施法锚点</font></span></span>]效果来释放专属技能时，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"穿透伤害\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">穿透伤害</font></span></span>]提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性四星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/10/eer5d47lht2ycljkd8fe3yu05q10ccr.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E5%9B%9B%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/10/eer5d47lht2ycljkd8fe3yu05q10ccr.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E5%9B%9B%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/10/eer5d47lht2ycljkd8fe3yu05q10ccr.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E5%9B%9B%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦拥有技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"召唤•虚空投影\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">召唤•虚空投影</font></span></span>]；[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"命运刻度\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">命运刻度</font></span></span>]初始刻度为<font color=\"#ed7950\">6</font>，行动结束时推移<font color=\"#ed7950\">4</font>个刻度。<br />✦自身可透过[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虚空投影\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">虚空投影</font></span></span>]，触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"施法锚点\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">施法锚点</font></span></span>]效果来释放技能。<br />✦自身或[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虚空投影\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">虚空投影</font></span></span>]范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内，所有非[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">召唤物</span>]的己方获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"时空漫游\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">时空漫游</font></span></span>]。<br />✦攻击时，与目标距离每多<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>格（相邻距离算0格），魔攻提高<font color=\"#d68fe2\">3%</font>，最多<font color=\"#d68fe2\">15%</font>。<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"命运刻度\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">命运刻度</font></span></span>]初始刻度改为<font color=\"#ed7950\">12</font>，行动开始时推移<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>个刻度。<br />✦以触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"施法锚点\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">施法锚点</font></span></span>]效果来释放专属技能时，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"穿透伤害\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">穿透伤害</font></span></span>]提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性五星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/20/l6fgusj2lxp7caktkwbmf1ioo2m7utz.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%94%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/20/l6fgusj2lxp7caktkwbmf1ioo2m7utz.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%94%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/20/l6fgusj2lxp7caktkwbmf1ioo2m7utz.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%94%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦拥有技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"召唤•虚空投影\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">召唤•虚空投影</font></span></span>]；[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"命运刻度\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">命运刻度</font></span></span>]初始刻度为<font color=\"#ed7950\">6</font>，行动结束时推移<font color=\"#ed7950\">4</font>个刻度。<br />✦自身可透过[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虚空投影\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">虚空投影</font></span></span>]，触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"施法锚点\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">施法锚点</font></span></span>]效果来释放技能。<br />✦自身或[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虚空投影\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">虚空投影</font></span></span>]范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内，所有非[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">召唤物</span>]的己方获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"时空漫游\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">时空漫游</font></span></span>]。<br />✦攻击时，与目标距离每多<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>格（相邻距离算0格），魔攻提高<font color=\"#d68fe2\">4%</font>，最多<font color=\"#d68fe2\">20%</font>。<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"命运刻度\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">命运刻度</font></span></span>]初始刻度改为<font color=\"#ed7950\">12</font>，行动开始时推移<font color=\"#ed7950\">4</font>个刻度。<br />✦以触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"施法锚点\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">施法锚点</font></span></span>]效果来释放专属技能时，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"穿透伤害\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">穿透伤害</font></span></span>]提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">30%</font>。<br />✦菲娜塔首次释放[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"时间回溯\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">时间回溯</font></span></span>]时，使[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"命运刻度\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">命运刻度</font></span></span>]推移<font color=\"#ed7950\">6</font>个刻度。\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">\n<div class=\"skill_icon_box\">\n<div data-type=\"@悬浮框/技能2\" data-name=\"召唤•虚空投影\" class=\"bili-tt skill_icon_bg\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%8F%AC%E5%94%A4%E2%80%A2%E8%99%9A%E7%A9%BA%E6%8A%95%E5%BD%B1\" title=\"技能图鉴库/召唤•虚空投影\"><img alt=\"技能背景 传说.png\" src=\"htt